                  <div class="meta-pill"><i class="bi bi-person-workspace"></i><span><strong>Role:</strong> Senior Full-Stack Engineer</span></div>
                  <div class="meta-pill"><i class="bi bi-calendar3"></i><span><strong>Timeline:</strong> 12 weeks</span></div>
                  <div class="meta-pill"><i class="bi bi-people"></i><span><strong>Team:</strong> 1 PM, 1 designer, 2 engineers</span></div>
                  <div class="meta-pill"><i class="bi bi-layers"></i><span><strong>Stack:</strong> Laravel, React, Tailwind, MySQL</span></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-5">
              <div class="hero-visual" data-aos="fade-left" data-aos-delay="220">
                <div class="project-media">
                  <img src="/assets/img/projects/uagency/feature.webp" alt="UAgancy Agency Operations Platform for Client, Campaign, and Reporting Workflows main project preview" width="1600" height="1000" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
                </div>
                <div class="floating-card card-primary">
                  <span class="eyebrow">Agency Ops</span>
                  <strong>Client delivery, campaign tracking, and reporting moved into one coordinated platform instead of scattered spreadsheets and dashboards.</strong>
                </div>
