            </article>
            <article class="service-card">
              <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-bar-graph"></i>
              <h3>Reporting Workflows</h3>
              <p>Improved the process of assembling and sharing client-facing reporting.</p>
              <span>Reduced repetitive manual reporting effort.</span>
            </article>
            <article class="service-card">
              <i class="bi bi-kanban"></i>
              <h3>Delivery Visibility</h3>
              <p>Created a clearer internal view of work status and campaign progress.</p>
